4a40z","userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9251},{"id":1783986340983,"text":"是我的错。其实我对感情是很悲观的","sender":"me","time":"14:22","timestamp":1784010177347,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9252},{"id":1783986340984,"text":"我不知道要怎么说，就是很悲观。悲观到我甚至不敢相信人间有真爱。一切都是会变的，某一天你也会变，只是那一天到底来的早还是来的晚，我们都不知道","sender":"me","time":"14:23","timestamp":1784010211758,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9253},{"id":1783986340985,"text":"但我很喜欢你。很喜欢你","sender":"me","time":"14:23","timestamp":1784010226442,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9254},{"id":1783986340986,"text":"不想用你的钱，是因为不想给你留下遗憾。我觉得所有感情如果都要散的话，那就不如好聚好散，而不是弄得两败俱伤","sender":"me","time":"14:24","timestamp":1784010247850,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9255},{"id":1783986340987,"text":"我习惯了这种没有安全感的生活。我也不敢依赖你，每次我和你睡完，我最需要你的时候，你转头就走，我的依赖无从安放，我的落差感很大，我歇斯底里和你吵架，但是我又知道实际上你也是有苦衷的，显得我像一个无理取闹的疯子","sender":"me","time":"14:24","timestamp":1784010283851,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9256},{"id":1783986340988,"text":"还不如独立一点，至少什么事情接受的时候都很平静。也不至于歇斯底里","sender":"me","time":"14:25","timestamp":1784010303010,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9257},{"id":1783986340990,"text":"杨景伊","rawContent":"杨景伊","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:25","timestamp":1784010350631,"roundId":"round_1784010305458_n017l6hwk","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782386286410_kgiv39iqq","characterId":"f83bdc69-bbea-4ed3-a184-5f232ca20e36","_id":9258},{"id":1783986340991,"sender":"them","